        <mxCell id="n_time" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=10;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;" value="&lt;b&gt;Time variance (§4)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Open period: no validTo. As of a date: validFrom &amp;lt;= $asOf AND (validTo IS NULL OR validTo &amp;gt; $asOf)&lt;br&gt;• usage: RESIDENTIAL | POSTAL | BUSINESS&lt;br&gt;• Returning to an old address = a second relationship to the same node&lt;br&gt;• One current name: the load closes the old period in the same transaction&lt;br&gt;• One current RiskScore per model; Party holds a copy of the current one" vertex="1">
