        <mxCell id="g_merch" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#1e293b;" value="&lt;b&gt;6 · Most transacted merchant&lt;/b&gt; (name only, not resolved) · top 7&lt;br&gt;Target: &lt;b&gt;MerchantName&lt;/b&gt;, owned by this profile, not shared · key &lt;b&gt;merchantNameKey&lt;/b&gt; = partyId + normalised name&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HAS_TOP_MERCHANT&lt;/b&gt; ×7 &amp;middot; &lt;b&gt;HAD_TOP_MERCHANT&lt;/b&gt; ×N (droppedAt)&lt;br&gt;{rank, txCount89d, amount89dMinor, firstAt, lastAt, actDays, actCounts, actAmountsMinor}&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Not shared between parties: raw names create false links and supernodes. Variants stay separate; once resolved, (:MerchantName)-[:RESOLVED_TO]-&amp;gt;(:Merchant).&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="184" width="490" x="805" y="1143" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="why" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=10;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;One profile node for each Party&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;• Party keeps one HAS_PROFILE instead of ~60 derived links&lt;br&gt;• Derived data is wiped and rebuilt one node per party&lt;br&gt;• Behavioural data is restricted as a unit&lt;br&gt;• One transaction per party writes all six groups, so groups never contend on the node&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="125" width="470" x="40" y="860" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="common" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=10;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;On every HAS_TOP_ / HAD_TOP_ relationship&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;rank&lt;/b&gt;: 1–7 (device 1–3). HAD_ keeps the rank at drop-out and &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;droppedAt&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;txCount89d&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;amount89dMinor&lt;/b&gt; (AUD): 90 days to the watermark&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;firstAt&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;lastAt&lt;/b&gt;: first and last transaction in the window&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;derivedBy, derivedAt&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="143" width="470" x="40" y="1000" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eod" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=10;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;" value="&lt;b&gt;EOD update (batch): the system of record for the profile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Source: warehouse or S3, since the graph keeps only the raw transaction window. One watermark per run: end of the previous day, Australia/Sydney&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Per party and group: recompute the 90-day measures for every entity, rank, keep the top 7 (device 3)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Write on change.&lt;/b&gt; Same entity: update rank and measures in place. Entering: create HAS_TOP_. Leaving: retype to HAD_TOP_ with droppedAt. Keep the N most recent drop-outs and delete older ones. A drop-out that re-enters is retyped back&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Rewrite act* entries up to the watermark, trim beyond 180 days, and confirm or remove intraday provisional entries&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Only parties with activity on the day entering or the day leaving the window change: skip the rest&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Partition by party; one transaction writes a party&#39;s six groups" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="300" width="640" x="1330" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="evt" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=10;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;" value="&lt;b&gt;Event-triggered update (per transaction)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;A. Compute at scoring&lt;/b&gt; (recommended default). No profile writes. The scorer reads the EOD profile plus transactions since the watermark (the day TransactionGroup) and re-ranks live. Always current for the score, no extra write load&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;B. Write-through&lt;/b&gt;, only if Hume or downstream systems need an intraday view. For each new transaction, update today&#39;s act* entry, the live counts and lastAt on the matching relationship, then re-rank in place. A new entity that may enter (rule below) is created as HAS_TOP_ with isProvisional: true; EOD confirms or removes it&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Either way: new transactions only (idempotent), and never change values up to the watermark&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; B costs up to 3 relationship writes per payment (counterparty group, device, IP) and serialises on the profile node. Use A for busy business parties" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="640" x="1330" y="415" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="out" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=10;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;" value="&lt;b&gt;An entity used since the watermark but not in the profile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Its 89-day count is at most its EOD 90-day count, which is at most the stored Nth&#39;s txCount90d. If that bound plus today&#39;s activity cannot reach the live Nth, ignore it. Otherwise:&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Accounts&lt;/b&gt;: read the exact EOD count from TRANSFERRED_TO, so the result stays exact&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;PayID, device, IP, merchant&lt;/b&gt;: the exact count is not in the graph. Use the bound and flag the feature provisional until EOD&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Entities not used since the watermark&lt;/b&gt; cannot overtake while the live Nth is at or above the stored Nth&#39;s txCount90d. Below that, flag the feature as possibly incomplete" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="640" x="1330" y="760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="open" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=10;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;" value="&lt;b&gt;Open&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Rank by count or by amount first&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; N for drop-outs (proposed: 3 per group)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Capture of the IP per transaction&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Merchant name normalisation rules" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="640" x="1330" y="925" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=10;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#1e293b;" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="640" x="1330" y="1055" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgn0" parent="1" style="ellipse;aspect=fixed;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#8b5cf6;strokeColor=#6d28d9;fontColor=#ffffff;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="24" x="1343" y="1088" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgt0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="PartyProfile (derived)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="270" x="1375" y="1088" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgn1" parent="1" style="ellipse;aspect=fixed;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#4c8eda;strokeColor=#2870c2;fontColor=#ffffff;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="24" x="1653" y="1088" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgt1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="Shared target node" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="270" x="1685" y="1088" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgn2" parent="1" style="ellipse;aspect=fixed;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#f79767;strokeColor=#f36924;fontColor=#ffffff;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="24" x="1343" y="1128" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgt2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="Per-profile node (not shared)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="270" x="1375" y="1128" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgn3" parent="1" style="ellipse;aspect=fixed;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#475569;dashed=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="24" x="1653" y="1128" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgt3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="Recent drop-out" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="270" x="1685" y="1128" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
